Optimize the exponential greed/inventory skew parameters.

## Goal
Find optimal skew coefficient and understand inventory dynamics.

## Current Logic (main.go:267-288)
- greed = exp(imbalance * skew) where imbalance = (inventory - target) / target
- buySpread = spread * greed, sellSpread = spread / greed
- Health penalty multiplies greed when win rate is poor

## Analysis
- Optimal skew coefficient (currently 1.0)
- Health score impact on greed
- Inventory distribution over time
- Greed factor distribution

## Experiments
- Test skew = {0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0}
- Test health penalty weight
